      "heading": "The right tap starts with three choices.",
      "intro": "Start with the mounting and where the tap will be used. Then choose a finish that suits the rest of your bathroom.",
      "title_1": "Choose the mounting",
      "body_1": "Exposed taps sit on the basin or wall. Concealed taps have a body inside the wall. Check the connections and available space first.",
